<!-- 插件窗口：命令下拉框 + 参数输入框，回车执行且窗口不消失，结果弹到右下角 -->
<Window x:Class="QiDian.PluginWindow"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
        xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
        mc:Ignorable="d"
        Height="140" Width="520"
        WindowStyle="None"
        AllowsTransparency="True"
        Background="Transparent"
        Topmost="True"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterScreen">
    <Grid Margin="16">
        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

        <!-- 输入区：命令下拉框 + 参数输入框 -->
        <Border Grid.Row="0"
                Background="#FFFFFF"
                CornerRadius="8"
                BorderBrush="#E4E7EB"
                BorderThickness="1"
                Padding="10,8">
            <Grid>
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                <!-- 命令下拉框 -->
                <ComboBox x:Name="CommandComboBox"
                          Grid.Column="0"
                          Width="130"
                          VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                          FontSize="14"
                          SelectionChanged="CommandComboBox_SelectionChanged">
                    <ComboBox.ItemTemplate>
                        <DataTemplate>
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Prefix, StringFormat={}{0}:}"
                                           FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                           Foreground="#1D4ED8"/>
                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Title}"
                                           Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                           Foreground="#1F2937"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </DataTemplate>
                    </ComboBox.ItemTemplate>
                </ComboBox>

                <!-- 参数输入框 -->
                <TextBox x:Name="ArgTextBox"
                         Grid.Column="1"
                         Margin="8,0,0,0"
                         BorderThickness="0"
                         Background="Transparent"
                         FontSize="16"
                         VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                         PreviewKeyDown="ArgTextBox_PreviewKeyDown"/>
            </Grid>
        </Border>

        <!-- 命令说明 / 快捷键提示 -->
        <TextBlock x:Name="HintText"
                   Grid.Row="1"
                   Text="选择命令，输入内容，按 Enter 执行（Esc 返回搜索）"
                   FontSize="12"
                   Foreground="#6B7280"
                   Margin="4,8,0,0"/>
    </Grid>
</Window>
